      "title": "Dhanlaxmi Bank Q2 results: Net profit more than doubles to ₹48.55 crore",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/companies/quarterly-results/dhanlaxmi-bank-q2-results-net-profit-more-than-doubles-to-48-55-crore-126102600661_1.html",
      "description": "Dhanlaxmi Bank on Monday reported more than a two-fold increase in net profit at Rs 48.55 crore in the second quarter of FY27.\nThe Kerala-based private sector bank had posted a net profit of Rs 23.20 crore in the July-September quarter of FY26.\nInterest income of the bank increased 23 per cent to Rs 471 crore during the second quarter of FY27, from Rs 384 crore in the corresponding period of FY26.\nGross non-performing assets improved to 1.76 per cent of gross advances during the quarter under review, from 3.10 per cent in the year-ago period.\nShares of Dhanlaxmi Bank were trading at Rs 32.73 on BSE, down 8.40 per cent from the previous close.",
      "source_name": "Business Standard Latest",
      "published": "2026-10-26T09:37:39"
    },
